## Workspace Tooling

### 1. Monorepo Synchronization
* When modifying frontend packages inside the `vendor/` directory of the `erp-ui` monorepo, synchronize package dependencies using `npm run vendor <module-name>` to copy updates to target folders before executing builds.
* **Desktop Synchronization**: Always run `npm run sync-desktop` inside `erp-ui` after modifying frontend components to sync the newly built production assets to the Wails desktop frontend source directory. This guarantees that changes are correctly reflected in the local desktop application.
